{"title":"1998 PMWC Answer Key","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>I1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a005f6bcc6523f04a799cd5381559018bdce167.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{2}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>I2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea9119513dcfff6adda7e89a8f0aa460eaed0305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$182$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>I3. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbe18900c777778ad24c84cb3d99df7032b4fd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I4. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d8911ed57672cebe73effdb50b99af8e45d12ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>I5. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I6. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I7. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I8. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a21383a2b05dbe4ed4ecd095273f0cabc32b78a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I9. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I10. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" a